<p style="color:#ccc;margin:0;line-height:1.75;font-size:.95rem;">An SEO strategy for B2B companies is a systematic plan to rank for the search queries that ideal customers use when researching their problems and evaluating solutions -- building topical authority through structured content clusters, earning backlinks from authoritative industry sources, and creating the technical foundation that allows Google to crawl, index, and rank every page at full authority. For growth-stage B2B companies, SEO's highest ROI comes from targeting bottom-of-funnel commercial intent queries (comparisons, alternatives, pricing) that reach buyers at the evaluation stage -- converting organic traffic directly to pipeline rather than building awareness with no path to revenue.</p>
